<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your files are ready</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .order-box { background: #faf9f7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; }
    .order-box .label { font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .order-box .order-number { font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; }
    .note { background: #fdf8f3; border-left: 4px solid #c8a882; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5a3e2b; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 EziHubb</h1>
      <p>Your digital download is ready</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Thanks for your order!</h2>
      <p>Your files are ready to download right away — no shipping, no waiting.</p>

      <div class="order-box">
        <div class="label">Order number</div>
        <div class="order-number">{{orderNumber}}</div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center">
        <a class="cta" href="{{downloadUrl}}">Download Your Files</a>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        Each file is licensed to this order only. Please don't share or resell your download — it helps keep the shop and its designs around for everyone.
      </div>

      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The EziHubb Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EziHubb. All rights reserved.<br />
      Questions? Reply to this email or visit our help centre.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
